04: Media

Ok for this one I just had fun making a bit of a gag. I think people take for granted being able to access and construct literally anything
out of literally anything. Its incredible.

But anyways I did try using a mask originally for the curtain, but it was interacting really weirdly with the bottom image
I opted instead for just squishing it instead using the same scroll script from 03, which is much funnier and more efficient.
add in a little sound effect set to go off whenever you're juuust about to raise the curtain over HIS face, using the script I made in 02 and you're golden! kind of ended up using bits of all the projects that came before it
in this one which is neat

also turns out GIFs don't need to use the formatting of a video, you can just insert them like images. Cool!